OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerous' spectacled caiman
OL,4,Afound in suburban semi
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "dangerous" crocodilian has been
OL,7,Frecovered from a suburban home after
OL,8,Freports it was being kept without a
OL,9,Flicence.
OL,11,FThe spectacled caiman, classified as
OL,12,Fdangerous under the Dangerous Wild
OL,13,FAnimal Act 1976, was seized from a
OL,14,Fsemi-detached house in Hale, Greater
OL,15,FManchester, on Wednesday.
OL,17,FLyle the caiman was found, along with a
OL,18,Fpython, after a Trafford Council-led
OL,19,Foperation also involving police and the
OL,20,FRSPCA. Both animals have since been
OL,21,Fmoved to a zoo, said the council.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
