OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerous' spectacled caiman
OL,4,Afound in suburban semi
OL,5,
OL,6,F"These animals have highly specialised
OL,7,Fneeds that are incredibly difficult to
OL,8,Fmeet in a domestic setting," said RSPCA
OL,9,Fexotic animal expert Evie Button.
OL,10,F"Their welfare can be severely
OL,11,Fcompromised when they are kept as
OL,12,Fpets."
